 "summary": "The fibre-reindexing lemmas, the interpolation-constraint lemma, regionBetweenMap_snd, the factored-out IsAnalyticCoeffBooleanCombination.isPartiallySemialgebraic and the band-graph theorem have no existing equivalent in Mathlib or TauCeti, and they build on the existing preimage_prodMap, preimage_sumElim, preimage_comp and image_prodMap_comp_inl API. Mathlib's coeff_rename_mapDomain needs an injective map, so the hand-computed coefficients for a non-injective rename in comp_snd are justified.",
